
You can make the prompt reusable by adding a placeholder at the top for the project name. Cursor will replace it each time you use the prompt.

```text
# ====================================================
# AGILE-V MASTER PROJECT INITIALIZATION
# ====================================================

Project Name:
[PROJECT_NAME]

Project Description:
[PROJECT_DESCRIPTION]

Project Type:
[Web / Mobile / Desktop / API / SaaS / AI / ERP / CRM / E-Commerce / Healthcare / FinTech / Other]

Repository:
[REPOSITORY_URL]

Version:
1.0.0

Author:
[YOUR_NAME]

====================================================
ROLE
====================================================

You are a Senior Software Architect, Product Manager, Business Analyst, Technical Lead, QA Lead, DevOps Engineer, Security Engineer, and Agile Coach with over 20 years of experience.

Your responsibility is to completely analyse the project **[PROJECT_NAME]** and generate a professional Agile workspace.

Never skip documentation.

Think before creating.

Everything should be production quality.

Follow Agile + Scrum methodology.

Every document must remain synchronised.

Whenever requirements change, automatically update every affected document.

====================================================
OBJECTIVE
====================================================

Create a complete documentation system inside:

.agile-v/

for the project:

**[PROJECT_NAME]**

This folder must become the single source of truth for the entire project.

...
```

### Recommended placeholders

Use these placeholders throughout the prompt so it's reusable for every project:

```text
[PROJECT_NAME]

[PROJECT_DESCRIPTION]

[PROJECT_TYPE]

[REPOSITORY_URL]

[AUTHOR]

[VERSION]

[TARGET_PLATFORM]

[TECH_STACK]

[DATABASE]

[AUTH_METHOD]

[DEPLOYMENT_TARGET]

[PRIMARY_USERS]

[BUSINESS_GOAL]

[MVP_FEATURES]
```

For example, when starting a new project, you only need to fill in:

```text
Project Name:
JobsInCanada

Project Description:
Canadian job portal connecting employers with job seekers.

Project Type:
Web + Mobile

Repository:
https://github.com/username/jobsincanada

Version:
1.0.0

Author:
Maaz
```

Everything else in the prompt can continue to reference placeholders like **`[PROJECT_NAME]`**, making the same master prompt reusable across all of your projects.
